    "body": "on FBSDKKeychainStore.m is reported by static security scans as \"Privacy violation\".\r\n\r\nFrom security scan report: \r\n\r\n\"The function setData:forKey:accessibility:() in FBSDKKeychainStore.m mishandles confidential information on line 94. The program could compromise user privacy.The identified function mishandles confidential information. This program could compromise user privacy. \"\r\n\r\n\"Explanation\r\nPrivacy violations occur when:\r\n1. Private user information enters the program.\r\nIn this case the data comes from  in FBSDKAccessTokenCache.m at line 49.\r\n2. The data is written to an external location, such as the console, file system, or network.\r\nIn this case the data is passed to setObject:forKey:() in FBSDKKeychainStore.m at line 94.\"\r\n\r\nReport is performed by Fortify.com\r\n",
